Description: Tooling to develop and extend the 'metasurvey' ecosystem: scaffolding
    generators for recipes and custom backends, and a bundled kit of Claude Code
    development agents and slash commands (rOpenSci reviewer, CRAN reviewer, doc
    auditor, smart-commit, and more) that can be installed into a project's
    '.claude' directory.
